@base = http://localhost:18083/simple-service-tasks

### Deploy the shared process model (201 with Location)
POST {{base}}/deploy

### Happy path: save this IDE-local UUID for message correlation
< {%
  const key = "xxxxxxxx-xxxx-4xxx-yxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx".replace(/[xy]/g, c => {
    const r = Math.floor(Math.random() * 16);
    return (c === "x" ? r : (r & 3) | 8).toString(16);
  });
  client.global.set("correlationKey", key);
%}
POST {{base}}/start-process?value={{correlationKey}}&intValue=123

### Wait for listener delivery; copy the taskId below
GET {{base}}/tasks

### Complete before the one-minute timer expires
@taskId = REPLACE_WITH_TASK_ID
POST {{base}}/tasks/{{taskId}}/complete?value=user-task-value

### Automatic send-message worker runs, then message1 is waiting
POST {{base}}/correlate/{{correlationKey}}?value=message-value

### Business error: 42 takes action_error, then waits for signal1
POST {{base}}/start-process?value={{$uuid}}&intValue=42

### Broadcast after received_signal becomes active (inspect Operate)
POST {{base}}/signal?value=signal-value

### Timer: start, leave its user task untouched for one minute, then send signal above
POST {{base}}/start-process?value={{$uuid}}&intValue=123

### Unsupported native user-task BPMN error: 501; task remains active
POST {{base}}/tasks/{{taskId}}/error?value=task-error-value
